{
  "id": "studio",
  "name": "Studio doll",
  "version": 1,
  "about": "A swappable art pack. To use your own illustrated base: copy this folder, replace the SVG (or PNG) layers, edit the anchors below to match your art's proportions, and point the app at the new folder name. Clothes, ordering and fitting never touch the art files.",
  "view": [0, 0, 500, 900],
  "tokens": "Layer files may contain {{skin}} {{skinLight}} {{skinShade}} {{hair}} {{hairLight}} {{hairShade}} {{browC}} {{eyes}} {{eyesLight}} {{lips}} {{lipsShade}} {{blush}} {{under}} {{underLine}}; they are filled from the customizer. PNG layers are used as they are.",
